msgid "第三方软件与归属"
msgstr "Third-party software and ownership"

msgid "来源"
msgstr "Provenance"

msgid ""
"依赖下载身份由 ``configs/dependencies.lock.json`` 给出，源码子模块由 ``.gitmodules`` 和 gitlink 固定。fetch "
"校验摘要；原生生产目标只消费已验证缓存。 Linux 6.12 Kbuild/Kconfig 的来源与逐文件摘要见 ``scripts/kbuild-source.json``。 "
"不能直接修改上游引擎来绕过项目边界。"
msgstr ""
"``configs/dependencies.lock.json`` identifies dependency downloads; ``.gitmodules`` and gitlinks "
"pin source submodules. fetch verifies digests; native production targets consume only verified "
"caches. Linux 6.12 Kbuild/Kconfig provenance and per-file digests are in ``scripts/kbuild-"
"source.json``. Do not modify the upstream engine directly to bypass project boundaries."

msgid ""
"``make fetch-check`` 检查锁定下载地址的可用性，不比较上游版本。 依赖升级需要另行核对对应 Alpine 仓库索引或上游正式发布，并同步版本、 "
"下载地址、SHA256、补丁和构建适配中的版本信息。APK 同时验证官方签名； 运行库与开发包采用匹配版本，升级后重新检查构建与运行行为。"
msgstr ""
"``make fetch-check`` checks availability of locked download URLs; it does not compare upstream "
"versions. Dependency upgrades require separate checks against the relevant Alpine repository index"
" or official upstream release, updating versions, download URLs, SHA256, patches, and version "
"references in build adaptations together. APKs also undergo official signature verification. "
"Runtime and development packages use matching versions; recheck build and runtime behavior after "
"upgrades."

msgid ""
"当前 GRUB 2.16 的 EFI 路径使用 GOP；上游已移除仅用于旧固件的 UGA 支持， 镜像模块清单不再请求 ``efi_uga``。Legacy BIOS 的引导路径保持独立。"
msgstr ""
"The current GRUB 2.16 EFI path uses GOP. Upstream removed UGA support, which served only old "
"firmware, so image module lists no longer request ``efi_uga``. The legacy BIOS boot path remains "
"separate."

msgid ""
"musl、BusyBox、GRUB、认证库等保留各自原生构建与 移植边界。目标程序与开发 SDK 的 staging 不可混用。上游 README、许可证、 "
"COPYING、归属和字体许可是来源资料，保留原文，不属于待清理的过程报告。"
msgstr ""
"musl, BusyBox, GRUB, authentication libraries, and other dependencies retain their native builds "
"and porting boundaries. Do not mix target-program staging with development-SDK staging. Upstream "
"README files, licenses, COPYING, attribution, and font licenses are provenance materials; retain "
"their original text. They are not process reports to be cleaned up."

msgid ""
"musl 的互斥锁属性探测补丁将内核缺少 PI futex 的 ``ENOSYS`` 转换为 POSIX 的 ``ENOTSUP``，以便 PulseAudio 等调用者回退到普通互斥锁。 "
"该补丁不伪装成已实现优先级继承，也不改变其他 futex 错误。补丁及摘要由 依赖锁管理；已有镜像需要重新构建 musl 和系统包才会取得此修正。"
msgstr ""
"The musl mutex-attribute probe patch converts ``ENOSYS`` for missing kernel PI futex support to "
"POSIX ``ENOTSUP``, allowing callers such as PulseAudio to fall back to ordinary mutexes. It does "
"not pretend priority inheritance is implemented and leaves other futex errors unchanged. The "
"dependency lock manages the patch and digest; existing images require rebuilt musl and system "
"packages to receive the fix."

msgid ""
"ReliefPlayer 的 MP4 解码使用官方 FFmpeg 8.1.3 源码，以 LGPL 配置构建 "
"``avformat``、``avcodec``、``avutil``、``swresample`` 和 ``swscale``。 源码 "
"tag、commit、归档摘要和许可证由依赖锁固定；构建使用独立的 ``-reliefplayer`` 库名和 SONAME，避免与用户安装的完整 FFmpeg 运行库发生文件及提供者冲突。 "
"只将选中的播放器所需运行库与 LGPL 原文装入 ``reliefos-media-codecs`` 包， 不向镜像发布 FFmpeg 命令行程序或开发头文件。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefPlayer decodes MP4 with official FFmpeg 8.1.3 sources, building ``avformat``, ``avcodec``, "
"``avutil``, ``swresample``, and ``swscale`` with an LGPL configuration. Source tag, commit, "
"archive digest, and license are pinned by the dependency lock. Separate ``-reliefplayer`` library "
"names and SONAMEs prevent file/provider conflicts with user-installed full FFmpeg runtimes. Only "
"the selected player runtime libraries and original LGPL text enter ``reliefos-media-codecs``; "
"FFmpeg command-line programs and development headers are not shipped in the image."

msgid "移植与打包"
msgstr "Porting and packaging"

msgid ""
"添加依赖时同步获取锁、配置/组件、Kbuild 适配、运行路径、包归属、 动态库依赖、桌面入口及许可证。不要仅为安装成功关闭上游验证。 标准控制台工具没有必要伪装成自研图形应用或分配桌面图标。 "
"上游源码修订先在其仓库提交并推送，再更新父仓引用。"
msgstr ""
"When adding dependencies, update the fetch lock, configuration/components, Kbuild adaptations, "
"runtime paths, package ownership, shared-library dependencies, desktop entries, and licenses "
"together. Do not disable upstream validation merely to make installation succeed. Standard console"
" tools need not masquerade as in-house graphical applications or receive desktop icons. Commit and"
" push upstream source revisions in their own repositories before updating parent-repository "
"references."

msgid "预编译基础依赖"
msgstr "Prebuilt base dependencies"

msgid ""
"sl、ncurses、zlib、libpng、SQLite 和 mbedTLS 3 使用 Alpine v3.24 x86_64 的 原始签名 APK；不再初始化对应的六个源码子模块。准确版本与 "
"SHA256 均在依赖锁中。 运行时 APK 经过 ``upstream-apk`` 校验；``runtime-development`` 仅从锁定且通过 官方签名校验的运行、dev 和 "
"static 包暂存匹配的头文件与库，不将开发树覆盖到来宾。 生产构建离线消费缓存，缺包时先执行 ``make fetch``。"
msgstr ""
"sl, ncurses, zlib, libpng, SQLite, and mbedTLS 3 use original signed APKs from Alpine v3.24 "
"x86_64; their six source submodules are no longer initialized. Exact versions and SHA256 values "
"are in the dependency lock. Runtime APKs are verified by ``upstream-apk``. ``runtime-development``"
" stages matching headers and libraries only from locked runtime, dev, and static packages whose "
"official signatures have passed verification; it does not overlay the development tree onto the "
"guest. Production builds consume caches offline; run ``make fetch`` first if packages are missing."

msgid ""
"``libreliefos.so.2`` 和 ``libleonos.so.2`` 通过 ELF NEEDED 引用独立的 PNG、zlib、 mbedTLS 库。所有使用方采用 "
"``mbedtls3-dev`` 的配置头；不能继续定义旧的 ALT 配置， 也不能混用 main 仓库的 mbedTLS 4.x。时钟、熵和线程接口由官方库经 musl/内核获取， "
"证书链、域名、有效期验证继续生效。"
msgstr ""
"``libreliefos.so.2`` and ``libleonos.so.2`` reference separate PNG, zlib, and mbedTLS libraries "
"through ELF NEEDED. All consumers use configuration headers from ``mbedtls3-dev``; old ALT "
"configurations must not remain defined, and mbedTLS 4.x from main must not be mixed in. Official "
"libraries obtain clock, entropy, and threading services through musl/the kernel; certificate-"
"chain, hostname, and validity-period checks remain active."

msgid ""
"ReliefMail 链接标准 ``libsqlite3.so.0``，不再单独编译 amalgamation 或旧的 ``sqlite.so.3`` 自定义 VFS。数据库继续使用 DELETE"
" journal、FULL synchronous、 foreign_keys，并显式设置 ``mmap_size=0``。扩展库的厂商私有符号不是稳定 ABI， "
"需要使用它们的外部应用应针对独立库及同版本头文件重新构建。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefMail links standard ``libsqlite3.so.0`` instead of separately compiling the amalgamation or "
"the old custom ``sqlite.so.3`` VFS. Databases retain DELETE journaling, FULL synchronous, and "
"foreign_keys, and explicitly set ``mmap_size=0``. Vendor-private symbols in extension libraries "
"are not stable ABI; external applications needing them should rebuild against the separate "
"libraries and matching headers."

msgid ""
"``component:sl``、``component:ncurses``、``component:sqlite`` 锁特性由镜像的 ``etc/reliefos/apk-"
"components`` 选择，保留 BUILD/IMAGE 的组件约束；运行库的 基础依赖在控制台和桌面配置中均可用。命令和库由官方包直接提供，不生成本地 "
"包装包、注册表包装入口或迁移说明载荷。离线更新器迁移旧 world 请求并卸载旧包， 保留独立的许可证文本。许可证在 ``resources/licenses``， SDK 另带原始 "
"``.PKGINFO`` 记录；源码和构建配方可从对应 Alpine aports 获取。"
msgstr ""
"The image's ``etc/reliefos/apk-components`` selects the ``component:sl``, ``component:ncurses``, "
"and ``component:sqlite`` lock features, retaining BUILD/IMAGE component constraints. Base runtime "
"dependencies are available in both console and desktop configurations. Official packages directly "
"provide commands and libraries; no local wrapper packages, registry wrapper entries, or migration-"
"note payloads are generated. The offline updater migrates old world requests and uninstalls old "
"packages, retaining separate license texts. Licenses are in ``resources/licenses``; the SDK also "
"includes original ``.PKGINFO`` records. Sources and build recipes are available from the "
"corresponding Alpine aports."

msgid ""
"目标 ABI 使用实际 SDK 在 Linux/QEMU 验证。带 ASan 的 glibc 宿主测试不能链接 musl 静态归档，因此 ``host-runtime-development`` "
"从锁定的同版本 SQLite/mbedTLS 发布归档 构建原生测试库（使用官方配置）；该目标仅属于测试，不参与系统、SDK 或发行包构建。 可通过 "
"``RELIEFOS_TEST_DEP_ROOT`` 指向其他 O 的 ``host/runtime-development``。"
msgstr ""
"Validate the target ABI on Linux/QEMU using the actual SDK. ASan-enabled glibc host tests cannot "
"link musl static archives, so ``host-runtime-development`` builds native test libraries from "
"locked, same-version SQLite/mbedTLS release archives using official configuration. This is a test-"
"only target and does not participate in system, SDK, or release-package builds. "
"``RELIEFOS_TEST_DEP_ROOT`` may point to another O's ``host/runtime-development``."
